stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Ingested : Gmail sync or demo load

    Ingested --> EmbeddingComputed : compute_embedding()

    EmbeddingComputed --> PriorityScored : classify_priority()

    PriorityScored --> FraudScored : detect_phishing()

    FraudScored --> ExplanationGenerated : generate_explanation()

    ExplanationGenerated --> Verified : verify_claims()

    Verified --> [*]

    state Verified {
        [*] --> Unopened
        Unopened --> Opened : POST /ui/emails/{id}/panel
    }

    note right of Ingested : All further states can\nbe re-entered if version\nbumps trigger re-analysis

